# Server-rotation rendering: the mixin temporarily writes render-yaw into
# both the "current" and "previous-tick O" rotation fields so that MC's
# rotLerp(partialTick, O, current) always resolves to renderYaw regardless
# of where in the tick interval the frame lands.  Without the O fields the
# model lerps back toward client rotation at low partial-tick values and the
# effect is nearly invisible.  All six fields are widened here as a safety
# net; in builds where they are already public these entries are no-ops.
